--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed, and the question rows from the
-- committed bank JSONs under tools/course-banks/farmout/intermediate.
--
-- What this tier owns: CAPS, VESTING, VALUE AND THE FEE. Gross-cost and carry-amount
-- caps with the two overrun rules; drill-to-earn events and the two vesting
-- rules; the value of the deal to each side by EMV; the break-even promote
-- and the break-even chance of success; the consent fee of the 2024
-- Regulations with the value of the transaction stated and the day rules.
--
-- AN ENGINE COURSE. There is no Suite app: the practicals run in the course's
-- own deal calculator. The capstone grades six values of this tier, each identical
-- under every reading the engine states and never a Monte Carlo draw.
-- ============================================================================

